# memo
===
 Local-first AI assistant with real memory, agent tool use, and proactive habits — built with Go + Flutter. Runs fully offline via llama.cpp, recalls context across sessions with local RAG, edits files/runs commands as an agent, and integrates WhatsApp + calendar. No cloud, no telemetry, open source.
